  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Haiti Cholera Response Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utilizing an integrated approach, the United Nations Haiti Cholera Response Multi-Partner Trust Fund provides quick and flexible financing for responses to cholera in Haiti. Initiatives are designed and implemented in accordance with the needs, requirements, and strategic objectives of a&#x202F;new approach to humanitarian programming and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
